  "releaseNotes": "0.13.0 adds observable terminal color control: 16-bit TerminalColor values; OSC 4 indexed-palette mutation/query and OSC 104 reset; semantic OSC 10-14/17/19 dynamic-color mutation/query with resets 110-114/117/119; strict color response parsing; explicit unscoped lifecycle semantics; and downstream Icod.DCurses typed color-observation acceptance.",
